> `G_red` *transversally, and* `G.(G+2C') = F(C)`. *Thus* `(C')^2 > 0`. *Putting*
> `(Y, C', G)` *in place of* `(X, D, E)` *in 2.5, we see that* `gamma(C')` *is central
