+`s(C;P)=2` and, in the same sentence, the condition `C^2>4r(C)`.  Resolve a node
+once.  With exceptional curve `E`, total exceptional part `G=2E`, strict
+transform `F`, `E^2=-1`, and `F.E=2`, Nori's own definition gives
+
+```text
+s = (2E).(2E+2F) = -4+8 = 4.
+```
